// A whole program in one module, which is the only shape a checked
// build has today: `sema.Checker` reads every module out of ONE `Ast`
// and a `Parser` builds its own, so a compilation of two files cannot
// be assembled into the tree the checker needs. See `check` in
// src/zen/zen_build.zen.
//
// It imports nothing for the same reason, and that is what makes it a
// one-module program rather than a program with one file in it.

Answer* = {
    n*: i32,
}

answer* = () i32 { 42 }
